Description: AR OS native Wayland desktop and system applications
 AR OS is a Qt 6/QML desktop shell and coherent set of system applications
 running on KWin Wayland. It includes the shell, launcher, dock, notifications,
 files, settings, software, updater, first-run setup, lock UI, and distribution
 integration files.

